#: ../../cli.md:1
msgid "命令行工具 sapicli"
msgstr "sapicli command line tool"

#: ../../cli.md:3
msgid ""
"`sapicli` 是独立的 Go 程序（仓库 [sapicd/cli](https://github.com/sapicd/cli)），不依赖 "
"Python 环境，官方发布 Windows / macOS / Linux 三端压缩包（amd64 与 arm64），解压即用，功能覆盖上传、 "
"相册、有效期、输出风格与剪贴板复制。"
msgstr ""
"`sapicli` is a standalone Go program "
"([sapicd/cli](https://github.com/sapicd/cli)) that needs no Python "
"environment. Official builds are published as archives for Windows / "
"macOS / Linux on amd64 and arm64 and run as soon as you unpack them, "
"covering uploads, albums, expiry, output styles and clipboard copying."

#: ../../cli.md:8
msgid ""
"`sapicli` 是**独立项目**，从 **v0.6.0**（2026-11）起**同时支持 v1 与 v2 接口**：`-u` 只填站点 "
"根地址（接口路径自动拼接），`-t` 在 v2 站点上换成 PAT（`sp_` 开头）。参数、输出风格与剪贴板行为 在 v1 / v2 "
"下完全一致，接口版本默认自动判定，也可以用 `-A` 指定。更早的版本只认 v1 接口。"
msgstr ""
"`sapicli` is a **separate project**, and since **v0.6.0** (2026-11) it "
"**speaks both the v1 and the v2 API**: `-u` takes only the site root (the "
"API path is appended automatically) and `-t` takes a PAT (`sp_...`) on a v2 "
"site. Arguments, output styles and clipboard behaviour are identical on both "
"versions; the API version is detected automatically and may be pinned with "
"`-A`. Older releases only talk to v1."

#: ../../cli.md:13
msgid "功能"
msgstr "Features"

#: ../../cli.md:15
msgid "批量上传任意数量图片（并发上传），支持匿名上传与临时图片（有效期）"
msgstr ""
"Upload any number of images in one go (concurrently), including anonymous "
"uploads and temporary images (expiry)"

#: ../../cli.md:16
msgid "设置相册、标题/描述"
msgstr "Set the album, title and description"

#: ../../cli.md:17
msgid "多种输出风格：`default`、`typora`、`line`、`empty` 与自定义模块"
msgstr ""
"Several output styles: `default`, `typora`, `line`, `empty` and custom "
"modules"

#: ../../cli.md:18
msgid "上传结果跨平台复制到剪贴板，支持 URL / Markdown / rST 三种格式"
msgstr "Copy results to the clipboard on any platform as URL / Markdown / rST"

#: ../../cli.md:20
msgid "v1 与 v2"
msgstr "v1 and v2"

