msgid "项目"
msgstr "Item"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "v1 站点"
msgstr "v1 site"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "v2 站点（本仓库当前版本）"
msgstr "v2 site (current version of this repository)"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "上传接口"
msgstr "Upload endpoint"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`POST /api/upload`"
msgstr "`POST /api/upload`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`POST /api/v2/upload`"
msgstr "`POST /api/v2/upload`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "认证头"
msgstr "Auth header"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`Authorization: LinkToken <token>`"
msgstr "`Authorization: LinkToken <token>`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`Authorization: Bearer <PAT>`"
msgstr "`Authorization: Bearer <PAT>`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "请求体"
msgstr "Request body"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "表单，图片 base64 放在 `picbed` 字段"
msgstr "Form data, with the image base64-encoded in `picbed`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`multipart/form-data`，文件放在 `file` 字段"
msgstr "`multipart/form-data`, with the file in the `file` field"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "相册"
msgstr "Album"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`album`（相册名）"
msgstr "`album` (album name)"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`album_id`（`-a` 传名称时工具先解析成 id）"
msgstr "`album_id` (`-a` resolves a name to its id first)"

#: ../../cli.md:29
msgid ""
"`-u` 只写**站点根地址**（如 `https://your.site`），`/api/upload` 或 `/api/v2/upload` "
"由工具 自动拼接；写成 `https://your.site/api/v2` 也可以，工具会把路径剥掉再补。"
msgstr ""
"`-u` takes only the **site root** (e.g. `https://your.site`); `sapicli` "
"appends `/api/upload` or `/api/v2/upload` itself. Passing "
"`https://your.site/api/v2` works too: the tool strips the path and adds it "
"back."

#: ../../cli.md:31
msgid ""
"v2 的令牌是 **PAT**：站点「设置 → 访问令牌」里创建，勾选 `upload` 作用域，形如 `sp_...`。 `-a` "
"传**相册名**时工具要先 `GET /api/v2/albums` 解析 id，令牌需要同时带 `read`（默认创建就含）； 直接传**相册 "
"id** 则只要 `upload`。相册名解析失败只会打一行日志并退回令牌默认相册，不会中断上传。"
msgstr ""
"On v2 the token is a **PAT**: create one under Settings → Access tokens with "
"the `upload` scope; it looks like `sp_...`. When `-a` carries an **album "
"name** the tool first resolves the id via `GET /api/v2/albums`, so the token "
"also needs `read` (included by default); passing the **album id** needs only "
"`upload`. A name that cannot be resolved just logs a line and falls back to "
"the token's default album — the upload still happens."

#: ../../cli.md:34
msgid ""
"v2 的响应信封（`code` / `message` / `data`）会被展平成 v1 的结果结构，`-s` 与 `-c` 的表现 "
"不变；失败时 `message` 里会附上 `request_id`，排查问题时可凭它在服务端日志里定位。"
msgstr ""
"The v2 response envelope (`code` / `message` / `data`) is flattened into the "
"v1 result shape, so `-s` and `-c` behave exactly the same; on failure the "
"`message` carries a `request_id` you can search for in the server logs."

#: ../../cli.md:37
msgid "**接口版本自动判定顺序**（`-A auto`，默认）："
msgstr "**API version detection order** (`-A auto`, the default):"

#: ../../cli.md:39
msgid "显式指定的 `-A`；"
msgstr "an explicit `-A`;"

#: ../../cli.md:40
msgid "`-u` 里已经带了 `/api/v2` 或 `/api/upload`；"
msgstr "`-u` already contains `/api/v2` or `/api/upload`;"

#: ../../cli.md:41
msgid "探测 `GET /api/v2/site`（5 秒超时），`data.version` 以 `2.` 开头即 v2；"
msgstr ""
"probing `GET /api/v2/site` (5 s timeout): a `data.version` starting with "
"`2.` means v2;"

#: ../../cli.md:42
msgid "令牌以 `sp_` 开头；"
msgstr "a token that starts with `sp_`;"

#: ../../cli.md:43
msgid "都不满足就回退 v1。"
msgstr "otherwise it falls back to v1."

#: ../../cli.md:45
msgid "站点探测不到（内网、离线、域名不可达）时用 `-A v2` 明确指定最省事。"
msgstr ""
"When the probe cannot reach the site (intranet, offline, unresolvable host), "
"spelling out `-A v2` is the simplest fix."

#: ../../cli.md:47
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Install"

#: ../../cli.md:49
msgid ""
"到 [cli release](https://github.com/sapicd/cli/releases) 下载对应压缩包：Windows 选"
" `xxx-windows-amd64.zip`（ARM 机器选 `arm64`），macOS Intel 选 `xxx-darwin-"
"amd64.tar.gz`、 Apple Silicon 选 `xxx-darwin-arm64.tar.gz`。压缩包里只有一个可执行文件，放进"
" `PATH` 里的目录， 或直接用绝对路径调用。"
msgstr ""
"Download the archive for your platform from the [cli "
"releases](https://github.com/sapicd/cli/releases): `xxx-windows-amd64.zip` "
"for Windows (`arm64` for ARM machines), `xxx-darwin-amd64.tar.gz` for Intel "
"macOS and `xxx-darwin-arm64.tar.gz` for Apple Silicon. The archive holds a "
"single executable — put it in a directory on `PATH`, or call it by absolute "
"path."

