"variable"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-t`"
msgstr "`-t`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "令牌：v1 用 LinkToken，v2 用 PAT（`sp_` 开头，需 `upload`）；也可用环境变量 `sapicli_apitoken`"
msgstr ""
"Token: a LinkToken on v1, a PAT (`sp_...`, needs `upload`) on v2. Also "
"available as the `sapicli_apitoken` environment variable"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-a`"
msgstr "`-a`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "相册，可覆盖令牌默认相册；v2 支持相册名或相册 id"
msgstr ""
