#: ../../cli.md:142
msgid ""
"**剪贴板复制**：`-c url` 复制裸地址，`-c md` 复制 `![1.png](http://cdn.com/1.png)`， `-c"
" rst` 复制 reST 的 `.. image::` 形式；多个文件的结果用换行连接。Windows 用 `clip`， macOS 用 "
"`pbcopy`，Linux 需要先装 `xclip`（仅桌面环境）。"
msgstr ""
"**Clipboard**: `-c url` copies the bare URL, `-c md` copies "
"`![1.png](http://cdn.com/1.png)` and `-c rst` copies the reST `.. "
"image::` form; results for several files are joined with newlines. "
"Windows uses `clip`, macOS uses `pbcopy`, and Linux needs `xclip` "
"installed (desktop only)."

#: ../../cli.md:147
